Rule 22    sensortype_or_var -> SENSORTYPE
Rule 23    sensortype_or_var -> ID
Rule 24    instruction -> RENT EQUIPMENT COLON number_or_var COMMA hour_or_var COMMA hour_or_var COMMA date_or_var
Rule 25    instruction -> CANCEL EQUIPMENT COLON number_or_var
Rule 26    instruction -> BUY MEAL COLON dishtype_or_var COMMA date_or_var
Rule 27    instruction -> CANCEL MEAL COLON number_or_var
Rule 28    instruction -> REGISTER USER COLON STRING COMMA STRING COMMA NIF COMMA EMAIL COMMA ID COMMA PASSWORD COMMA USERTYPE
Rule 29    instruction -> REGISTER EQUIPMENT COLON ID COMMA number_or_var
Rule 30    instruction -> REGISTER EQUIPMENT COLON sensortype_or_var COMMA number_or_var COMMA float_or_var
Rule 31    action -> RENT
Rule 32    action -> BUY
Rule 33    action -> REGISTER
Rule 34    action -> CANCEL

